9)(38:35)","meaning":"The Supreme Bestower","desc":"The One who gives generously and continuously, without expecting anything in return.","otherNames":["The Bestower","The Giver of Gifts"]},{"number":17,"name":"الرَّزَّاق","transliteration":"Ar-Razzaq","found":"(51:58)","meaning":"The Total Provider","desc":"The Sustainer, The Provider.","otherNames":["The Constant Provider","The Ever-Providing"]},{"number":18,"name":"الفَتَّاح","transliteration":"Al-Fattah","found":"(34:26)","meaning":"The Opener","desc":"The Solver, The Reliever, The Judge, The One who opens for His slaves the closed worldly and religious matters.","otherNames":["The Judge"]},{"number":19,"name":"العَلِيم","transliteration":"Al-Alim","found":"(2:158)(3:92)(4:35)(24:41)(33:40)","meaning":"The All-Knowing One","desc":"The Knowledgeable; The One nothing is absent from His knowledge","otherNames":["The Omniscient","The All-Knowing"]},{"number":20,"name":"القَابِض","transliteration":"Al-Qabid","found":"Hadith list (Tirmidhi 3507)","meaning":"The Restricting One","desc":"The Constrictor, The Withholder, The One who constricts the sustenance by His wisdom and expands and widens it with His Generosity and Mercy.","otherNames":["The Restrainer","The Withholder"]},{"number":21,"name":"البَاسِط","transliteration":"Al-Basit","found":"Hadith list (Tirmidhi 3507)","meaning":"The Extender","desc":"The Englarger, The One who constricts the sustenance by His wisdom and expands and widens it with His Generosity and Mercy.","otherNames":["The Expander"]},{"number":22,"name":"الخَافِض","transliteration":"Al-Khafid","found":"Hadith list (Tirmidhi 3507)","meaning":"The Reducer","desc":"The Abaser, The One who lowers whoever He willed by His Destruction and raises whoever He willed by His Endowment.","otherNames":["The Abaser"]},{"number":23,"name":"الرَّافِع","transliteration":"Ar-Rafi","found":"Hadith list (Tirmidhi 3507)","meaning":"The Elevating One","desc":"The Exalter, The Elevator, The One who lowers whoever He willed by His Destruction and raises whoever He willed by His Endowment.","otherNames":["The Elevator","The Exalter"]},{"number":24,"name":"المُعِزّ","transliteration":"Al-Mu'izz","found":"Hadith list (Tirmidhi 3507)","meaning":"The Honourer-Bestower","desc":"He gives esteem to whoever He willed, hence there is no one to degrade Him; And He degrades whoever He willed, hence there is no one to give Him esteem.","otherNames":["The Bestower of Honor","The Honourer"]},{"number":25,"name":"المُذِلّ","transliteration":"Al-Mudhill","found":"Hadith list (Tirmidhi 3507)","meaning":"The Abaser","desc":"The Dishonourer, The Humiliator, He gives esteem to whoever He willed, hence there is no one to degrade Him; And He degrades whoever He willed, hence there is no one to give Him esteem.","otherNames":["The Humiliator","The Dishonourer"]},{"number":26,"name":"السَّمِيع","transliteration":"As-Sami","found":"(2:127)(2:256)(8:17)(49:1)","meaning":"The All-Hearer","desc":"The Hearer, The One who Hears all things that are heard by His Eternal Hearing without an ear, instrument or organ.","otherNames":["The All-Hearing"]},{"number":27,"name":"البَصِير","transliteration":"Al-Baseer","found":"(4:58)(17:1)(42:11)(42:27)","meaning":"The All-Seeing","desc":"The All-Noticing, The One who Sees all things that are seen by His Eternal Seeing without a pupil or any other instrument.","otherNames":[]},{"number":28,"name":"الحَكَم","transliteration":"Al-Hakam","found":"(6:114)","meaning":"The Impartial Judge","desc":"The Judge; He is the Ruler and His judgment is His Word.","otherNames":["The Giver of Justice","The Judge"]},{"number":29,"name":"العَدل","transliteration":"Al-Adl","found":"Hadith list (Tirmidhi 3507)","meaning":"The Embodiment of Justice","desc":"The Just, The One who is entitled to do what He does.","otherNames":["The Utterly Just"]},{"number":30,"name":"اللَّطِيف","transliteration":"Al-Lateef","found":"(6:103)(22:63)(31:16)(33:34)","meaning":"The Knower of Subtleties","desc":"The 